Welcome to **CommunityCoins**.

This Forgejo instance is a working library of software, infrastructure and
coordination material for community-driven cryptocurrencies. It is organised
by technical domain so that repositories can remain useful beyond any one
individual or temporary team.

Maintenance is currently centralised. The structure is designed to let
independent contributors and future teams take responsibility for individual
repositories without turning CommunityCoins into one monolithic project.

